  | ^^^^^^
  |
  = help: fixable with --fix: empty the line

conf/app.cnf:4:8: info MDL307[spaces-around-equals] spaces around "="
  |
4 | threads = 4
  |        ^^^
  |
  = help: fixable with --fix: write threads=4

conf/app.cnf:6:1: error MDL108[bracket-state-leak] empty line becomes "= 1" because of the "[" on line 5
  = impact: rejects the whole file: every option in it is ignored
  |
6 |
  | ^
  |
  = note: conf/app.cnf:5:7: the pre-processor state freezes at this "["
  = help: fixable with --fix: delete the empty line

conf/app.cnf:7:11: warning MDL313[quoted-value] value is wrapped in quotes
  = impact: writes the dump into a directory named "/backup", quotes included
  |
7 | outputdir="/backup"
  |           ^^^^^^^^^
  |
  = help: fixable with --fix --unsafe-fixes: remove the quotes

conf/app.cnf:7:20: error MDL302[trailing-whitespace-in-value] value ends with whitespace
  = impact: keeps the space: outputdir names another directory
  |
7 | outputdir="/backup"
  |                    ^
  |
  = help: fixable with --fix --unsafe-fixes: trim the value

conf/app.cnf:8:1: warning MDL205[duplicate-group] group [mydumper] is declared twice
  = impact: merges both groups silently
  |
8 | [mydumper]
  | ^^^^^^^^^^ (and 1 more line)
  |
  = note: conf/app.cnf:1:1: first declared here
  = help: fixable with --fix --unsafe-fixes

